@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+Fix incorrect deserialization of python timedelta object to ISO 8601 for negative time deltas.
+Minus was serialized in incorrect place ("P-1DT23H59M59.888735S" instead of correct "-P1DT23H59M59.888735S")
